{"availability":"available","full":"2nspired/supabase-sso-demo","name":"supabase-sso-demo","description":"A demo project showcasing a unified authentication system using Supabase Auth and SvelteKit 5. It supports both standard email/password login for individual users and SAML-based SSO (Single Sign-On) for organizations via Google Workspace and Okta. ","category":"Other","language":"Svelte","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2025-05-18T06:16:32Z","updated":"2025-05-23T04:29:35Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://supabase-sso-demo.vercel.app","topics":["auth-flow","authentication","b2b-saas","google-workspace","okta","saml","sso","supabase","svelte","sveltekit"],"demo":"https://supabase-sso-demo.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T00:00:04.574Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T00:00:04.574Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T00:00:04.574Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T00:00:04.574Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Svelte"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This project demonstrates a unified authentication system in SvelteKit, powered by Supabase Auth. It supports both individual users and organizations, enabling Single Sign-On (SSO) via Google Workspace. The login flow intelligently adapts based on the user's email domain—automatically routing organization users to SSO and allowing standard login for individuals. This approach provides seamless onboarding for SaaS and enterprise use cases, and highlights best practices for handling identity management and account duplication challenges when integrating SSO with Supabase."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/2nspired/supabase-sso-demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"81d50a7e58c203c6ec22a499ce9dc044f1dc678c66d204cb085f702c90535b1d","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T00:00:04.700Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T00:00:04.700Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This project demonstrates a unified authentication system in SvelteKit, powe